WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0033 (the party): BG3's companions drawn in WoW like the hero.
Companions follow the hero in world mode and show in WoW, client-only (party-design.md).
The capture layer's Tav copy now holds the hero and her companions in one plan, each mesh with its
figure (TVM1 record word 14; TavPlan.lua figures). wowbg3_tav draws each companion's figure under a
root of its own at its own place, on WoW's ground by a ground lock of its own (wowbg3_lead's
ground_under), with its own ground shade; poses (idle, walk, run, fight) are BG3's own every frame.
blob_shadow lays the WoW blob shadow under each companion (PartyFeet). wowbg3_fight: a stand-in's
attack on a companion (strikes.bin flag 16) plays with BG3's own facing and no WoW victim.
